- feat: security check tags, bulk delete by tag and side-by-side tables
- feat: SupraWeed files are locked against deletion
- feat: language and theme move into «О программе»
- feat: downloads and updates go through chagear.top
- style: coloured part of the program name, as on chagear.top
- style: bigger table layout switch, as tall as the run button
